Since $T _ { 1 }$ is not a grounded test case, UnitCon applies more rules to expand the placeholders in $T _ { 1 }$ . Among the multiple placeholders, UnitCon selects the least recently generated one, which is the highlighted ID. UnitCon applies the argument expansion rules and derives new partial test cases. Below, we present two representative cases:

